# Magnetic Snuffler: its enters trigger takes an Equipment card only from *your* graveyard, and it grows only when *you* sacrifice an artifact. Bot2's
# Thinking Cap is destroyed (Bot2's own Shatter) and sits in Bot2's graveyard: on turn 3 the Snuffler, entering, has no legal target and Bot2's Cap stays
# there. Bot2 then sacrifices its Black Lotus for mana (an artifact sacrificed, not by Bot1): the Snuffler stays a 4/4 with no counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Magnetic Snuffler
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Thinking Cap
Shatter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Thinking Cap.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Shatter.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Thinking Cap)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Graveyard = Shatter; Thinking Cap
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Magnetic Snuffler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Magnetic Snuffler.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Magnetic Snuffler.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Magnetic Snuffler.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Black Lotus; Shatter; Thinking Cap
